{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong> </strong></i>  <br>You find yourselves together in a grim place full of strange creatures. Stick together, explore the area, and look for a way to deal with whatever lives here. Every moment is tension, chaos, and the constant feeling that everything can go wrong.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132280/extras/2a507bbbd549a4b95840a45370d341db.poster.avif?t=1773730556\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132280/extras/2a507bbbd549a4b95840a45370d341db.webm?t=1773730556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132280/extras/2a507bbbd549a4b95840a45370d341db.mp4?t=1773730556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes the only way to survive is to hold the threat back at any cost. Block paths, hold doors, help each other buy time \u2014 but with physics and ragdoll in play, a single mistake can send you flying.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132280/extras/5b80694e31c2f3e193c686605e6feb8b.poster.avif?t=1773730556\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132280/extras/5b80694e31c2f3e193c686605e6feb8b.webm?t=1773730556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132280/extras/5b80694e31c2f3e193c686605e6feb8b.mp4?t=1773730556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything can fall apart in an instant. While one of you is trying to get out, another is already running from something chasing them. There are no safe 